            <ArticleTitle>Endometriosis: a possible cause of right shoulder pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>19-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although endometriosis is a common condition it can present with a wide range of symptoms. We report a case of chronic right hypochondrial and shoulder pain which proved to be due to endometriosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
